# Line endings: this is a web/JS project, so text is LF both in the repository and in every
# working tree -- that makes the built artifacts identical on any machine (an earlier CRLF
# checkout silently produced an exe with 78,848 extra 0x0D bytes).
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe needs CRLF in batch files (labels and goto break on LF-only .bat).
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Binaries: never touched by any text conversion.
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.apk binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.nupkg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.so binary
*.jar binary